What:		/proc/boost_pool/camera
What:		/proc/boost_pool/ion_boost_pool_uncached
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	KAI-Miru
Description:
	Read/write control and status for the cached camera and uncached ION
	page-reserve pools. Reading reports the current, original, low, and high
	watermarks plus per-order page counts. Writing 0 resets the pool to its
	original watermarks, -1 stops refilling, and a larger positive page count
	requests an asynchronous prefill up to that high watermark.

What:		/proc/boost_pool/camera_low
What:		/proc/boost_pool/ion_boost_pool_uncached_low
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	KAI-Miru
Description:
	Read/write low-watermark controls for the two ION boost pools. Values are
	page counts; the implementation reports the equivalent MiB when read.

